# dumps
# Measured reflection data recovered from a real session. reflection/ and catalog/ are the
# evidence plan/TODO.md cites — they are the difference between "we measured this" and
# "someone has to boot the game and measure it again", so they ship. The rest is scratch.
dumps/*
!dumps/reflection/
!dumps/catalog/